A note on what this covers, which the MIT text above cannot say for itself:

The licence is intended for the TEMPLATE — the components, styling, build
setup, tests, and the AI-DLC workflow record. Fork it, strip the content, and
make it yours; that is what it is here for.

The files under `src/content/` are one person's résumé: employment history,
credentials, and contact details. Copying those verbatim is not a licensing
question but an honesty one — replace them with your own. Nothing in this
licence grants any right to use "Marlow Fernandez" as a name, or to represent
someone else's work experience as your own.
